      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0000)]！"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "id": "msg_main0120_sister_08",
      "hash": "53ba86ed78cba5dd",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR POKNAME(0002)]在你身上，\\n完全就是一副好搭档的样子呢。"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "id": "msg_main0120_sister_09",
      "hash": "53ba85ed78cba42a",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "那就请收下这个\\n对你们再适合不过的礼物吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "id": "msg_main0120_sister_02",
      "hash": "53ba7ced78cb94df",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0000)]！"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "msg_main0120_sister_03",
      "hash": "53ba7bed78cb932c",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0000)]从大姐姐那里\\n得到了[VAR COLOR(0006)]运动服[VAR COLOR(0000)]！"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "id": "msg_main0120_sister_10",
      "hash": "53b6f8ed78c87ebc",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0000)]把[VAR COLOR(0006)]运动服[VAR COLOR(0000)]\\n放入了换装箱里！"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "id": "msg_woman1_01_p04_t001_r0201",
      "hash": "88cdc8cd98530ffb",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 6]"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "id": "msg_main0120_sister_04",
      "hash": "53ba7aed78cb9179",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "让[VAR POKNAME(0002)]穿上它，\\n你们就可以穿同款服装冒险了哦！"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "id": "msg_main0120_sister_06",
      "hash": "53ba78ed78cb8e13",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "……哎呀？"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "id": "msg_main0120_sister_05",
      "hash": "53ba79ed78cb8fc6",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "嘻嘻嘻！[VAR POKNAME(0002)]似乎\\n很想和你玩呢。\\r\\n你要经常和它一起玩哦。"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "id": "msg_main0120_sister_07",
      "hash": "53ba77ed78cb8c60",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR COLOR(0006)]Ｘ键[VAR COLOR(0000)]菜单里\\n新增了[VAR COLOR(0006)]和[VAR PKNICK(0003)]玩[VAR COLOR(0000)]！\\c\\n点选后就能在任何时候\\n和[VAR PKNICK(0003)]一起玩了！"
    }
